import{_ as n,o,c as t,a2 as i}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const u=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 714 | Hyper-Multiverse Strong Ones' Post Duties · Cross-Plane Anchor Construction Post","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 714 | Hyper-Multiverse Strong Ones' Post Duties · Cross-Plane Anchor Construction Post","no":714,"module":4,"tags":["Post Duties","Cross-Plane Anchor","Plane Onboarding","Plane-Coordinate Master Library","Law Barrier"],"related":["28-Cross-Plane Anchor Connection","80-Plane Theory and Classification","81-Plane-Travel Rules"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0714_模块4-跨位面锚点建设岗.md","filePath":"en/0714_模块4-跨位面锚点建设岗.md"}`),a={name:"en/0714_模块4-跨位面锚点建设岗.md"};function s(r,e,l,c,d,h){return o(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[i('<h1 id="entry-714-hyper-multiverse-strong-ones-post-duties-·-cross-plane-anchor-construction-post" tabindex="-1">Entry 714 | Hyper-Multiverse Strong Ones&#39; Post Duties · Cross-Plane Anchor Construction Post <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-714-hyper-multiverse-strong-ones-post-duties-·-cross-plane-anchor-construction-post" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 714 | Hyper-Multiverse Strong Ones&#39; Post Duties · Cross-Plane Anchor Construction Post&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 28, 80, 81</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-connecting-isolated-islands-into-a-continent" tabindex="-1">Introduction: connecting isolated islands into a continent <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-connecting-isolated-islands-into-a-continent" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: connecting isolated islands into a continent&quot;">​</a></h2><p>If the Law-Network Maintenance Post is &quot;defending,&quot; the Cross-Plane Anchor Construction Post is &quot;opening.&quot; Its core work is to take the cosmos&#39;s isolated planes one by one — planes not yet connected to the anchor network, planes that are law-self-consistent but cut off from the outside, even planes that have drifted in the cosmos for eons — connect them to anchors one by one, joining them into a continent. This does not exist at all in old web novels: old web novels&#39; planes are either the protagonist&#39;s leveling maps, where he leaves after fighting; or cages ruled by villains, shattered by the protagonist&#39;s fist. No one ever thought of connecting a plane <strong>as a living civilizational unit</strong> into the symbiotic network.</p><p>Six top-level axioms in this entry converge into the word &quot;onboarding&quot;: the anti-predation axiom requires the onboarding process develop increments and not plunder the onboarded plane&#39;s stock; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires all beings in the onboarded plane gain equal evolution qualification; the collective ascension axiom requires onboarding expand the Myriad-Origin two-way cycle&#39;s coverage; the causal self-discipline axiom requires the onboarding process strictly observe-first-then-limit-interference; the law-first axiom requires post-onboarding law docking not tear apart either side&#39;s self-consistency.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-post-positioning-the-grid-connection-engineer-of-plane-civilizations" tabindex="-1">I. Post Positioning: The &quot;Grid-Connection Engineer&quot; of Plane Civilizations <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-post-positioning-the-grid-connection-engineer-of-plane-civilizations" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Post Positioning: The &quot;Grid-Connection Engineer&quot; of Plane Civilizations&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Cross-Plane Anchor Construction Post transcended ones&#39; work is to safely, completely, and low-disturbingly connect a new plane to Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s anchor network. This is not simply &quot;opening a portal&quot;; it includes a whole engineering process:</p><ul><li><strong>Survey</strong>: pure-observation survey of the target plane, mapping its physical constants, energy density, time flow, consciousness activity;</li><li><strong>Assess</strong>: judge the plane&#39;s law self-consistency, civilizational development stage, whether native predatory-faction remnants exist;</li><li><strong>Negotiate</strong>: contact the native civilization&#39;s representatives (if it already has a civilization), explain the meaning and cost of onboarding;</li><li><strong>Dock</strong>: open a minimal interface on the law barrier, deploy anchor hardware, establish energy channels;</li><li><strong>Fuse</strong>: let the plane&#39;s origin energy join the Myriad-Origin two-way cycle, letting its beings begin enjoying the Selfless-Dao public library;</li><li><strong>Trace</strong>: the whole process is filed in Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision, auditable at any time.</li></ul><h2 id="ii-six-iron-rules-of-the-onboarding-process" tabindex="-1">II. Six Iron Rules of the Onboarding Process <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-six-iron-rules-of-the-onboarding-process" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Six Iron Rules of the Onboarding Process&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Cross-plane onboarding is a high-risk operation; this post has six iron rules:</p><ol><li><strong>Observe before interfere</strong>: the survey stage completes at least three full cycles of pure observation, without any interference;</li><li><strong>Do not disturb native causality</strong>: the onboarding point is chosen at the edge of the native civilization&#39;s causal main chain, avoiding disturbance to its history;</li><li><strong>Do not plunder native stock</strong>: after onboarding, only establish a two-way energy cycle, not draw out the native origin stock;</li><li><strong>Respect native self-determination</strong>: if the native civilization refuses onboarding, do not force grid connection; only retain an observation channel;</li><li><strong>Law docking does not tear</strong>: at onboarding, do law-fingerprint comparison; design a law-compatibility layer at the interface;</li><li><strong>Report and trace throughout</strong>: every step of operation goes through causal self-discipline reporting; Alaya Network leaves traces.</li></ol><h2 id="iii-why-onboarding-is-a-key-link-of-perpetual-construction" tabindex="-1">III. Why Onboarding Is a Key Link of Perpetual Construction <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-why-onboarding-is-a-key-link-of-perpetual-construction" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Why Onboarding Is a Key Link of Perpetual Construction&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Cross-plane onboarding is the core means by which the Myriad-Origin two-way cycle expands total flow. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s cosmos keeps expanding — new planes, new cosmoses, new law regions keep emerging. If these newly emerging planes are not onboarded, they become <strong>islands of the law network</strong>: beings on the island live and die in isolation; energy on the island entropically dissipates in isolation.</p><p>Onboarding-post transcended ones connect these islands one by one into the continent, bringing three increments:</p><ol><li><strong>Life increment</strong>: billions of beings on the island gain cultivation paths, cultivation resources, and cross-plane channels;</li><li><strong>Energy increment</strong>: the island&#39;s origin energy begins flowing into the Myriad-Origin two-way cycle, enlarging the public pool;</li><li><strong>Law increment</strong>: the island&#39;s unique law combination, after compatibility-layer processing, becomes new material for the law network.</li></ol><p>This is &quot;develop increments, do not consume stock&quot; landing at cross-plane scale — <strong>onboarding is not possession, but symbiosis</strong>.</p><h2 id="iv-difference-from-the-new-cosmos-frontier-post" tabindex="-1">IV. Difference from the New-Cosmos Frontier Post <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-difference-from-the-new-cosmos-frontier-post" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Difference from the New-Cosmos Frontier Post&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Cross-Plane Anchor Construction Post (714) and the New-Cosmos Frontier and Law-Weaving Post (719) are often confused. The difference:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th></th><th>Cross-Plane Anchor Construction Post</th><th>New-Cosmos Frontier and Law-Weaving Post</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Work object</td><td>Planes that already exist</td><td>New cosmoses that do not yet exist and need weaving</td></tr><tr><td>Core action</td><td>Onboard, compatibilize, grid-connect</td><td>Design, weave, test</td></tr><tr><td>Risk type</td><td>Docking risk with native civilization</td><td>Self-consistency risk of new-law weaving</td></tr><tr><td>Output</td><td>Expanded Myriad-Rank coverage</td><td>Newly added law material library</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The two posts often cooperate: the Frontier Post first tests new laws in new cosmoses; the Construction Post then connects mature new laws into existing planes.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: connecting isolated planes&#39; energy and life into the cycle avoids their entropic dissipation on the island</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: six iron rules explicitly forbid drawing out native stock and forced grid connection; onboarding is invitation, not occupation</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-style planes are the protagonist&#39;s leveling maps, left after fighting; Heng Yuan Zhou-style planes are Myriad Ranks&#39; homes, left after onboarding</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the onboarding process explicitly covers every discovered plane, regardless of its civilizational stage, racial composition, or law combination</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: post-onboarding cultivation paths, law-compatibility layer, native-civilization knowledge all flow back to the Selfless-Dao public library</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Cross-Plane Anchor Construction Post is the frontline engineering post of Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s territorial expansion. It does not pursue conquest; it pursues connection — joining islands drifting in the cosmos one by one into a continent of Myriad-Rank symbiosis. Every plane onboarded adds a water source to the Myriad-Origin two-way cycle; every plane onboarded adds a fulfillment of the republican axiom of Myriad Races. <strong>This post&#39;s KPI is not how many enemies were shattered, but how many planes were onboarded.</strong></p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/28-跨位面锚点连接.html">Entry 28 · Cross-Plane Anchor Connection</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/80-位面理论与分类.html">Entry 80 · Plane Theory and Classification</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/81-位面穿梭规则.html">Entry 81 · Plane-Travel Rules</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/84-考古协议总纲.html">Entry 84 · Archaeological Protocol Overview</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',27)])])}const p=n(a,[["render",s]]);export{u as __pageData,p as default};
